        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in this highly regarded residential setting, 3 Fernhill Avenue is an attractive and exceptionally well-maintained family home, distinguished by its generous accommodation and an outstanding rear garden extending to almost 140ft.\r\n\r\nPresented in beautiful condition throughout, the property offers an excellent balance of practical living space, well-proportioned rooms and superb outdoor space—an increasingly rare combination in this popular location. The accommodation includes three bedrooms upstairs, two reception rooms, a kitchen, utility room, office and two bathrooms, making this an ideal home for families,  or those seeking flexible work-from-home space.\r\n\r\nThe spectacular, long garden provides wonderful scope for outdoor entertaining, play, gardening and future personalisation, subject to any necessary planning permission. It is a significant feature rarely found in a property of this type.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy an excellent selection of everyday amenities close by, including local shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, pubs, pharmacies, professional services and sports facilities. Terenure Village is known for its independent food and coffee scene, with popular local destinations including Lark, Dolly’s, Foam Coffeehouse, and a broad choice of pubs, restaurants and cafés. \r\n\r\nFor recreation, Bushy Park is one of the area’s defining amenities. The park offers extensive open space, woodland and riverside walks beside the River Dodder, sports pitches, tennis courts, playground facilities and other recreational areas. The popular Saturday market adds to the village’s community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe location also provides convenient access to Rathgar, Rathfarnham, Harold’s Cross, Templeogue and the city centre, while Dublin’s southside attractions, sporting facilities and shopping districts are readily accessible by car, bicycle or public transport.\r\n\r\nThe property is well positioned for access to a number of established schools. Nearby options include: Presentation Primary School, Presentation Community College, St Joseph’s Boys’ NS, St Pius X Boys’ and Girls’ NS, Our Lady’s School, Presentation College, Terenure College, Templeogue College, and many more nearby. \r\n\r\nServed by a broad network of Dublin Bus services, providing connections towards Dublin city centre. Routes associated with the area include routes 15, 15A, 16, 17, 49, 65 and 65B as serving the area. \r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround floor\r\nEntrance porch - 2.67m x 0.75m\r\nEntrance hall – 4.79m x 2.03m\r\nLiving room - 3.88m x 3.64m\r\nDining room - 3.88m x 3.42m\r\nKitchen - 2.92m x 3.92m\r\nUtility room - 2.79m x 2.46m\r\nOffice - 2.79m x 4.53m\r\nBathroom - 1.35m x 2.06m\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.13m x 2.45m\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.01m x 3.44m\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.79m x 3.62m\r\nBathroom - 2.25m x 2.14m\r\n\r\nProperty features\r\nc. 115 sq. m. (1,237 sq. ft.)\r\nOFCH\r\nF – BER rating\r\nOff street parking\r\nYear of construction: c. 1958\r\n\r\nKey features\r\nBeautifully presented throughout\r\nTwo reception rooms\r\nSeparate kitchen and utility room\r\nGround-floor office\r\nGenerous and versatile layout\r\nExceptional rear garden extending to almost 140ft\r\nExcellent family-friendly residential location\r\nConvenient access to Terenure Village, Bushy Park and the River Dodder\r\nStrong selection of local schools and amenities\r\nFrequent Dublin Bus services to the city and surrounding suburbs"
      },
